        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "<p>Brings Cylinder page-swipe effects to the <strong>CarPlay home screen</strong>. SpringBoard is not modified, so original Cylinder can stay on the iPhone.</p><p>Pick effects in Settings → Cylinder CarPlay, then reconnect CarPlay.</p>",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
