          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Features",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "<ul><li>CarPlay home page-swipe effects</li><li>Combine multiple Lua effects or randomize</li><li>Same scripts as Cylinder (<code>/Library/CylinderCarPlay</code>)</li><li>Also reads <code>/Library/Cylinder</code> if present</li><li>Coexists with Cylinder on SpringBoard</li><li>Japanese and English settings</li></ul>",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
